affle/img/car12.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/car13.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/car14.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
