            <description>&lt;img src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/img/top_letuce.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Featured image of post Letuces evolution&#34; /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;crops-evolution&#34;&gt;Crops evolution&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;I started my seedlings on December 14th 2020. In December th I planted the seedlings in mineral cubes and put them under LED light. One weed later December 29th, I put the cubes in the plant baskets and placed them in my containers.You can see the evolutions on the pictures below.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;december-14-2020&#34;&gt;December 14, 2020&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;I tried 4 kinds of letuces but the one presented here are the &amp;ldquo;Grosse Blonde Paresseuse&amp;rdquo;.&#xA;It was that lettuce that performed the most, with the less issues and the one that grew faster.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/11dec.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;january-4-2021&#34;&gt;January 4, 2021&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/4jan.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;january-8-2021&#34;&gt;January 8, 2021&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/8jan.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;january-12-2021&#34;&gt;January 12, 2021&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;I started eating them that week ! one month after the beginning !&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/12jan.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;january-19-2021&#34;&gt;January 19, 2021&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;I let 2 lettuces survived to see how big they could grow.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/19jan.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;january-23-2021&#34;&gt;January 23, 2021&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;I needed more space so I ate the smallest one&amp;hellip;.. 4 days later the diameter was 23 inches&amp;hellip;..&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/23jan.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
